  "title": "Teriyaki Roasted Chicken",
  "description": "A whole chicken is marinated with sweetened soy sauce, garlic, and lots of fiery ginger to make this delicious roast teriyaki chicken.",
  "authors": [
    "William Uncle Bill Anatooskin"
  ],
